  \oobeHello\HelloFingerprintVoiceOver:
    Candidate Language=UG-CN: Use Windows Hello to unlock your PC with just your fingerprint. It's not only faster, it's more secure than a password. Want to set that up now?
  \oobeHello\HelloFingerprintIconAriaLabel:
